" predictmeans: reference for corAR1xAR1() (dev/review-ar1ar1.md, S4), 2026-11-26.
  Slate Hall Farm (Genstat REML Guide, chapter 3): 150 plots, 10 field rows x
  15 field columns, 25 varieties, 6 replicates. The data are read below (from
  tests/testthat/_data/variogram/slatehall.csv: replicates, variety, fieldrow,
  fieldcolumn, yield), so nothing needs to be loaded first.
  Please send the whole output (.txt or .rtf/.pdf).

  Four models, each with variety fixed and AR1 x AR1 residuals:
   A  AR1 x AR1                               (R: gls)
   B  AR1 x AR1 + nugget (plot error, units)  (R: gls, nugget = TRUE)
   C  replicates random + AR1 x AR1           (R: lme)
   D  replicates random + nugget + AR1 x AR1  (R: lme, nugget = TRUE)
  For each: variance parameters, deviance, Wald tests with d.d.f., the 25
  variety means and all their SEDs (VPREDICT), printed to 8 decimals."

UNITS [NVALUES=150]
FACTOR [LEVELS=6] replicates
FACTOR [LEVELS=25] variety
FACTOR [LEVELS=10] fieldrow
FACTOR [LEVELS=15] fieldcolumn
VARIATE yield
READ replicates, variety, fieldrow, fieldcolumn, yield
